{"about_the_game":"<strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Welcome to Replay Value \u2013 the ultimate second-hand game store sim!</strong>  <br>Start from scratch and build your dream retro game shop in this quirky and satisfying job simulator. Buy and sell used games, negotiate with colorful customers, and turn forgotten discs into hot-shelf hits.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683940/extras/70a9ec64251bafa689be9b367cefbe6d.poster.avif?t=1772887037\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683940/extras/70a9ec64251bafa689be9b367cefbe6d.webm?t=1772887037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683940/extras/70a9ec64251bafa689be9b367cefbe6d.mp4?t=1772887037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Whether you're restoring a dusty classic or haggling over a rare gem, your goal is simple: make profit, grow your inventory, and create a store worthy of the name <i>Replay Value</i>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uded2 Features</h2><br><strong>\ud83c\udfae Buy, Sell, Haggle</strong>  <br>Deal with random customer requests every day\u2014some want to sell their collection, others are after something specific. Negotiate prices, make counter-offers, and decide when to walk away.<br><br><strong>\ud83e\uddfc Restore &amp; Reuse</strong>  <br>Fix up old games through interactive mini-games like CD cleaning, box repair, tag removal, and disk checks. Presentation matters\u2014clean games sell better!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683940/extras/dcd905f7559db02f5dc99e032c2adeba.poster.avif?t=1772887037\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683940/extras/dcd905f7559db02f5dc99e032c2adeba.webm?t=1772887037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683940/extras/dcd905f7559db02f5dc99e032c2adeba.mp4?t=1772887037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\ud83d\udce6 Manage Your Store</strong>  <br>Physically place games on your shop shelves, tag them with prices, and decide what to display. Want to sell something online instead? Use the digital storefront and check for end-of-day sales.<br><br><strong>\ud83d\udcc8 Upgrade &amp; Expand</strong>  <br>Invest your earnings to unlock new platforms like consoles and handhelds, buy extra shelves, and decorate your store with posters, stickers, and figures. Even run ads to bring in more customers!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683940/extras/9d110bff561eb49ba180a0a548f33f41.poster.avif?t=1772887037\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683940/extras/9d110bff561eb49ba180a0a548f33f41.webm?t=1772887037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683940/extras/9d110bff561eb49ba180a0a548f33f41.mp4?t=1772887037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\ud83d\udcca Daily Summary</strong>  <br>Track your profits, sold inventory, and missed opportunities with a handy end-of-day report, inspired by classic sim games.<br><br><strong>\ud83d\udcc5 Infinite Replayability</strong>  <br>With randomized customers, negotiation quirks, and hundreds of games to collect, every day is a fresh challenge. Can you master the market and make your shop the ultimate second-hand paradise?<br><br>Whether you're a collector at heart or just here for the hustle, <i>Replay Value</i> is a cozy, strategic sim full of nostalgia, charm, and unexpected deals.  <br><br>\ud83d\udce6 Time to clean up that cartridge, name your price, and make your shelf shine.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683940/extras/db05cef9a6e306046be1f626438696fb.avif?t=1772887037\" width=1560 height=460 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3683940?t=1772887037","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3683940?t=1772887037","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683940/8bdbe1954504ac665ace71216a9b80c2a5ce7fa3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772887037","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683940/8bdbe1954504ac665ace71216a9b80c2a5ce7fa3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772887037","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist &amp; Play the demo first! \u2728</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683940/extras/db05cef9a6e306046be1f626438696fb.avif?t=1772887037\" width=1560 height=460 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Welcome to Replay Value \u2013 the ultimate second-hand game store sim!</strong>  <br>Start from scratch and build your dream retro game shop in this quirky and satisfying job si